{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randy dreams of becoming a great photographer. To help him, his grandfather lends him his camera, promising that he can keep it if he proves he\u2019s ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world full of challenges that you can overcome by using your camera in creative ways. Earn <strong>photographer badges</strong> by collecting film rolls in each level and show that you have what it takes to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember, the camera is just a tool, what truly matters is your creativity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/extras/enterPhoto.gif?t=1747694166\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across 2 of the 7 worlds you will explore in the final game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/extras/mechanic.gif?t=1747694166\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your camera to capture and move objects, eliminate them to reset their positions, and use your creativity to overcome challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/extras/win.gif?t=1747694166\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect as many film rolls as possible to earn badges and prove your photography skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/extras/winter.gif?t=1747694166\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An extra fun costume is waiting for you!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3716860/fe960395b3883ff76add8dcfa760629873eedd53.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716860?t=1747694166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716860?t=1747694166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/b8d743e82f5e0a02a3936002062220db02c5d9e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747694166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/b8d743e82f5e0a02a3936002062220db02c5d9e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747694166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randy dreams of becoming a great photographer. To help him, his grandfather lends him his camera, promising that he can keep it if he proves he\u2019s ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world full of challenges that you can overcome by using your camera in creative ways. Earn <strong>photographer badges</strong> by collecting film rolls in each level and show that you have what it takes to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember, the camera is just a tool, what truly matters is your creativity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716860/extras/enterPhoto.gif?t=1747694166\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel across 2 of the 7 worlds you will explore in the final game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p